    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne on his gefæderan, ne on gehalgodre nunnan, ne on ælætan ænig Cristen mann æfre ne gewifige;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no Christian man shall ever marry his god-mother or a professed nun or a divorced woman.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne on his gefæderan, ne on gehalgodre nunnan, ne on ælætan ænig Cristen mann æfre ne gewifige;</ab>
      </div>
